# Jiten API key. Optional, but without it you lose your account's word
# coverage, the known-words upload and the list buttons.
#
# Make one at jiten.moe -> Settings -> Advanced -> API Key. It is shown ONCE.
#
# Jiten's own docs: this key "carries every permission your account has,
# including the calls that rewrite your known words and delete cards."
# Treat it like a password.
#
# Paste it on the line below. Lines starting with # are ignored.
